### 1. Task 4.1: GET paged collection (default size=5, sort=title)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Task 4.2: Page 0, size 3
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=3
Accept: application/json

### 3. Task 4.2: Page 1, size 3, sorted by year descending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=1&size=3&sort=year,desc
Accept: application/json

### 4. GET single book by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Task 3.3: GET non-existing book (404 ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/problem+json

### 6. POST create a new book (201 Created + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "year": 2017,
  "genre": "TECHNICAL"
}

### 7. DELETE book (1st call: 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 8. DELETE book (2nd call: 404 Not Found ProblemDetail)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 9. POST invalid book with empty title (400 Bad Request ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Martin Kleppmann",
  "year": 2017,
  "genre": "TECHNICAL"
}

### 10. POST duplicate book (409 Conflict ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "year": 2008,
  "genre": "TECHNICAL"
}

### 11. Task 4.3: Slice vs Page comparison (no count(*) query in Slice)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/slice?genre=NOVEL&size=3
Accept: application/json

### 12. Task 3.1: Derived query - findByTitleContainingIgnoreCase
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/derived/by-title?fragment=Java
Accept: application/json

### 13. Task 3.1: Derived query - findByYearBetweenOrderByYearDesc
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/derived/year-between?from=1940&to=1960
Accept: application/json

### 14. Task 3.1: Derived query - findTop3ByGenreOrderByYearDesc
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/derived/top3?genre=NOVEL
Accept: application/json

### 15. Task 3.1: Derived query - countByAuthorName
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/derived/author-count?name=George%20Orwell
Accept: application/json

### 16. Task 3.2: JPQL query with named parameters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?genre=NOVEL&year=1945
Accept: application/json

### 17. Task 3.2: Bulk update using @Modifying
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/archive?year=1950

### 18. Task 3.4: N+1 Demonstration (Without fetch join)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/n-plus-one?fetchJoin=false
Accept: application/json

### 19. Task 3.4: N+1 Demonstration (With JOIN FETCH)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/n-plus-one?fetchJoin=true
Accept: application/json

### 20. Variant 2: BookTag ManyToMany with addedAt attribute
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/variant2/book-tags
Accept: application/json
